    "detailed_description": "<h1>Coming Soon!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Enter a fascinating and seductive world with &quot;Succubus RoomMate&quot;. In this addictive cookie clicker game, you can buy cute power-up imps and immerse yourself in a story inside the protagonist's room. Unlock atmospheric scenes with your very own succubus and enjoy intense dialogues in pure anime style.<br><br><strong>Main features:</strong><br><br><strong>Cookie Clicker Experience:</strong> Start your adventure by frantically clicking to get virtual coins and power-ups in the shape of cute little devils. Accumulate ever-increasing wealth to buy new upgrades that accelerate your progression.<br><br><strong>Imps Upgrade:</strong> Each player will have an adorable collection of power-up imps at their disposal. Each imp will have unique and special abilities that will help you increase your productivity in the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/b99504a186397ddaf5437975f1db45d6.avif?t=1747172815\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/b199c512bc4bd7d7db97b681110339e9.avif?t=1747172815\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/0b5d89a56042a5af8f7f79af2125bd9e.avif?t=1747172815\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/6346bed18cdf08ffd93fc4e7d74b2bf8.avif?t=1747172815\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/f04e345c624715edb1396fbfe9f46ecc.avif?t=1747172815\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/89bbc12900801107329955a665d6aa38.avif?t=1747172815\" /></span><br><strong>Scene in the Protagonist's Chamber:</strong> Explore the intimacy of the protagonist's bedroom as the main setting of the game. Unlock different scenes to unlock different camera angles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/8a9664d6d9855d5ed1b94fe744d2e475.poster.avif?t=1747172815\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/8a9664d6d9855d5ed1b94fe744d2e475.webm?t=1747172815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502980/extras/8a9664d6d9855d5ed1b94fe744d2e475.mp4?t=1747172815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Personal Succubus: </strong> Thanks to the purchase of the scenes, you will unlock your personal succubus that will accompany you inside the chamber. Interact with her through engaging dialogues.<br><br><strong>Dialogues:</strong> Every time you buy a new scene, you will unlock dialogues with your personal succubus. deepen the emotional connection and get involved in emotions.<br><br><strong>Unlock achievements:</strong> as you progress through the game you will be able to unlock achievements on your steam profile.",
